---
---
<footer class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950 text-center">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-slate-400">
      <a 
        href="https://github.com/jsrubianoj" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors"
        aria-label="GitHub"
      >
        <i class="fa-brands fa-github text-lg"></i>
      </a>
      <a 
        href="mailto:jsrubianoj@gmail.com" 
        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors"
        aria-label="Email"
      >
        <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-lg"></i>
      </a>
      <a 
        href="https://cal.com/jsrubianoj" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors"
        aria-label="Cal.com"
      >
        <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check text-lg"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Sebastián Rubiano Jara. All rights reserved.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Originally written in 2021 using HTML5, Bootstrap 4, Sass, and jQuery (Start Bootstrap Stylish Portfolio).<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      Upgraded in 2026 to Astro &amp; Tailwind CSS using Antigravity and Gemini 3.5 Flash.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
